	if ((v1[r1]-v1[l1-1]*fac1[r1-l1+1]%M1+M1)%M1!=(v1[r2]-v1[l2-1]*fac1[r2-l2+1]%M1+M1)%M1)return 0;
	if ((v2[r1]-v2[l1-1]*fac2[r1-l1+1]%M2+M2)%M2!=(v2[r2]-v2[l2-1]*fac2[r2-l2+1]%M2+M2)%M2)return 0;
	return 1;
}
